but detectives failed to achieve any major breakthroughs. Reports on the matter ended with the bleak remark. The investigation continues. A little over a week later on April 28th, the Zodiac's threats escalated when he sent a cartoon greeting card to the Chronicle. It featured an image of a small man riding a donkey, alongside another small man riding a dragon. Printed above the image was the caption, sorry to hear your arse is a dragon.

